---
import OptimizedImage from "../../../components/OptimizedImage.astro";
---
<div class="w-full"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/projects/tiktok-camp/cover.webp" alt="Cover" width="2400" height="1768" class="block w-full h-auto" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" /></div>

    <article class="px-6 mb:px-16 dt:px-35 pt-10">
      <header>
        <h1 class="font-extrabold text-2xl mb:text-[32px] leading-10">Tiktok camp - UI design</h1>
      </header>
      <p class="mt-5 text-[16px] leading-6 font-normal text-pretty wrap-break-word max-w-225">“I worked on these projects when I was freelancing, collaborating with a close friend.<br>My friend took care of the sketching and working with clients, while I handled the coloring and UI design based on the wireframes provided by TikTok VietNam.”</p>
      <p class="mt-5 text-[16px] leading-6 font-medium">Category : Campaign LP design<br>Client : Tiktok VietNam<br>Tool used : Adobe Illustrator</p>

      <section class="mt-14 mb:mt-16 pt-8 border-t border-ink/15" aria-label="Campaign 01">
        <h2 class="text-[16px] leading-6 font-medium">01. Campaign for hashtags :<br>#Learn On Tiktok 2021 - 2022</h2>
        <div class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-1 dt:grid-cols-2 gap-10 mb:gap-12.5 items-start">
        <div class="w-full max-w-122.5 mx-auto"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/projects/tiktok-camp/01.webp" alt="Screen 1" width="2400" height="1768" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="w-full max-w-122.5 mx-auto"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/projects/tiktok-camp/03.webp" alt="Screen 3" width="2400" height="1768" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
